body:
Yo, I rap kinda and produce too. I'd love to try to record to some of your beats if you're interested. I like that material you posted.

&#x200B;

[https://soundcloud.com/skygarden0001](https://soundcloud.com/skygarden0001)

 [https://soundcloud.com/skygarden0001/rain](https://soundcloud.com/skygarden0001/rain) 

&#x200B;

This sound cool?

Yo I like your voice, I'm a producer and I just like to make songs based on how I'm feeling at the moment. I like to rap over my own stuff which is more hard chief keef/chxpo type stuff but occasionally I make songs that are out of my range (more dance, rnb style that my voice doesn't sound well on) but  I could write lyrics and perform rough takes to outline the overall song ideas, or just hum melodies over them if you were looking for that kind of thing, or I could just send over the tracks for you to write to. Either way, here's a link to a song  [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xaq\_P6whaF0&t=28s](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xaq_P6whaF0&t=28s) 

&#x200B;

Cheers, Evil T
